<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian treasury raises 65 mln dinars at auction.</title>
<headline>Tunisian treasury raises 65 mln dinars at auction.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Tuesday raised 65 million dinars at its weekly auction of treasury bills dated July 29, and repaid maturing paper totalling 71 million dinars.</p>
<p>Herewith breakdown of the results:</p>
<p>    Maturity			 Amount	Rate	Previous</p>
<p>week - Two-year notes payable</p>
<p>in equal annual tranches</p>
<p>					  25 MD     7.0000	  7.0000 -</p>
<p>Two-year payable at maturity</p>
<p>					  25 MD     7.0000	     -   -</p>
<p>52-week</p>
<p>					  15 MD     6.875	   6.9375</p>
<p>Banks bid for 266 million dinars for 52-week and two-year paper at between 6.875 and 7.2500 percent.</p>
<p>(one $=1.1400 dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
